stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Disabled
    Disabled --> ReadOnly: compile on + runtime read-only
    ReadOnly --> ShadowWrite: parser/fault gates pass
    ShadowWrite --> CanaryRW: disposable replay matches cold path
    CanaryRW --> StableOptIn: release gates + rollback drill
    StableOptIn --> DefaultOn: separate ADR, two release cycles

    ReadOnly --> EphemeralFallback: rejection spike / incompatibility
    ShadowWrite --> ReadOnly: write fault
    CanaryRW --> ReadOnly: write circuit opens
    CanaryRW --> EphemeralFallback: correctness/isolation incident
    StableOptIn --> EphemeralFallback: emergency kill switch
    EphemeralFallback --> ReadOnly: fixed reader + offline scan
